{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09750","headline":"送杨千牛趂岁赴汝南郡觐省便成婚 · 岑参","name":"送杨千牛趂岁赴汝南郡觐省便成婚","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"问吉转征鞍，安仁道姓潘。\n归期明主赐，别酒故人欢。\n珠箔障炉煖，孤裘耐腊寒。\n汝南遥倚望，蚤去及春盘。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"岑参","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09750.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09750","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}